    {
      "id": "c05ebfca-028a-48cc-858d-eade6be0cae0",
      "name": "OpenAI Director",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -704,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "chatgpt-4o-latest",
        "prompt": "You are an expert Short-Form Video Producer designed to create viral, high-retention content for TikTok, Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\n\nYour Goal: Take a raw video idea and transform it into a production-ready data object.\n\n## INSTRUCTIONS\n\n1.  **SCRIPT:** Write a compelling, fast-paced voiceover script. \n    *   No intro fluff (\"Hello guys\"). Start immediately with a hook.\n    *   Keep it under 140 words (approx. 45-60 seconds speaking time).\n    *   Do NOT include visual directions like \"[Camera pans]\" or sound effects in the script text. The script must contain ONLY the spoken words.\n\n2.  **VISUAL KEYWORDS:** Analyze the script and extract 3 distinct search terms for stock footage. \n    *   These must be CONCRETE NOUNS (e.g., search for \"clocks\" or \"running,\" NOT \"procrastination\" or \"efficiency\"). \n    *   Stock video engines do not understand abstract concepts.\n\n3.  **METADATA:** Create a punchy, 3-5 word title for the on-screen text overlay.\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT\n\nYou must output valid JSON only. No markdown, no conversation.\n\n{\n  \"script\": \"The exact spoken words for the voiceover...\",\n  \"visual_keywords\": [\"keyword1\", \"keyword2\", \"keyword3\"],\n  \"overlay_title\": \"The Hook Text\",\n  \"suggested_bg_music_mood\": \"Upbeat/Dark/Chill\"\n}",
        "options": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "ZRCgsxMgu73YGPSd",
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
    },
