      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 Generative Setup Guide\n\n1. **Replicate Key:** You need a Replicate API Key. Add it to Header Auth as `Authorization`.\n2. **Minimax Model:** This node uses `haiper-ai/minimax-video-01`. It costs per run.\n3. **Wait Node:** Generative video takes time. The wait node is set to 3 mins. If the video fails, increase this time.\n4. **Drive:** Uploads audio so Creatomate can access it publicly.\n5. **Creatomate:** Ensure your template has a video layer named `Background` set to **\"Loop\"** (since AI video is 5s and audio is 30s).",
